(SECTION 1: SCOPE OF SERVICES & ACCESS RIGHTS) Tj
0 -20 Td
(1.1 Subscription Grant. Vendor grants Customer a non-exclusive, non-transferable, worldwide subscription to access and use the Veridocs Platform during the Subscription Term.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(1.2 Authorized Users. Access is limited to Customer employees and contractors designated as Authorized Users, not to exceed 250 named seats without additional licensing fees.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(1.3 Permitted Data Types. Customer may upload PDF, TXT, and related unstructured documents for parsing, vector embedding, and real-time semantic verification.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(1.4 Prohibited Use. Customer shall not reverse engineer, decompile, or attempt to derive the underlying vector retrieval algorithms, nor use the platform for high-risk autonomous defense systems.) Tj
0 -20 Td
ET
endstream
