(SECTION 2: FEES, TAXES & PAYMENT SCHEDULE) Tj
0 -20 Td
(2.1 Annual Subscription Fee. The baseline annual platform fee is USD $120,000, invoiced annually in advance on thirty \(30\) days payment terms.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(2.2 Overages. Ingestion volume exceeding 50,000 document pages per calendar month shall be billed at $0.02 per indexed page.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(2.3 Late Penalties. Any undisputed invoice unpaid after thirty \(30\) calendar days from receipt shall accrue interest at 1.5% per month or the statutory maximum.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(2.4 Taxes. All amounts payable are exclusive of federal, state, local, or value-added taxes, which remain the sole responsibility of Customer.) Tj
0 -20 Td
ET
