(SECTION 3: SERVICE LEVEL AGREEMENT \(SLA\) & UPTIME) Tj
0 -20 Td
(3.1 Guaranteed Availability. Vendor guarantees a Monthly Uptime Percentage of at least 99.9% across all production API and web interfaces.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(3.2 Exclusions. Downtime shall exclude Scheduled Maintenance \(not to exceed 4 hours per calendar month with 48 hours advance notice\) and Force Majeure events.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(3.3 Service Credits. If Monthly Uptime drops below 99.9%, Customer is eligible for service credits as follows:) Tj
0 -20 Td
(    - 99.0% to 99.89%: 10% credit of monthly billing equivalent) Tj
0 -20 Td
(    - 95.0% to 98.99%: 25% credit of monthly billing equivalent) Tj
0 -20 Td
(    - Below 95.0%: 50% credit of monthly billing equivalent.) Tj
0 -20 Td
