(SECTION 4: DATA PROTECTION & PRIVACY) Tj
0 -20 Td
(4.1 Customer Data Ownership. Customer retains all right, title, and ownership in Customer Data uploaded to the Platform.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(4.2 Security Controls. Vendor implements AES-256 encryption at rest and TLS 1.3 in transit. Customer document vectors are stored in isolated SQLite partition databases.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(4.3 LLM Data Isolation. Vendor warrants that Customer Data and query texts are never utilized to train third-party foundation models without express written authorization.) Tj
0 -20 Td
